<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (POLICY TAKEAWAY This research exposed how cloud provider architectural choices and security practices can create systemic risks that individual organizations cannot easily address. While cloud providers prioritize ease of use, the resulting security trade-offs affect thousands of businesses and millions of consumers. The lack of provider action on long-standing issues, combined with inconsistent security practices across the industry, suggests a need for regulatory frameworks that better align cloud provider incentives with customer security needs.)
/E (POLICY TAKEAWAY This research exposed how cloud provider architectural choices and security practices can create systemic risks that individual organizations cannot easily address. While cloud providers prioritize ease of use, the resulting security trade-offs affect thousands of businesses and millions of consumers. The lack of provider action on long-standing issues, combined with inconsistent security practices across the industry, suggests a need for regulatory frameworks that better align cloud provider incentives with customer security needs.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
