478 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (DEF CON speakers routinely reach out to companies well in advance of the conference in this coordinated disclosure model. Beyond that, during DEF CON, participants in the AIxCC competition found a real bug in the open source project SQLite.* They reported it on August 6, 2024 and a fix was developed, tested and released by SQLite in about a week. This open source project demonstrated responsible engineering when contacted.)
/E (DEF CON speakers routinely reach out to companies well in advance of the conference in this coordinated disclosure model. Beyond that, during DEF CON, participants in the AIxCC competition found a real bug in the open source project SQLite.* They reported it on August 6, 2024 and a fix was developed, tested and released by SQLite in about a week. This open source project demonstrated responsible engineering when contacted.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [2]
>>
