/T (Unfortunately, a few companies ignore the advice of CISA and others to accept such reports and fix the problems, and choose to send in their lawyers. This thin-skinned response is often employed by companies that should know better, such as when, in 2007, Cisco threatened to sue Blackhat over the work of researcher Mike Lynn.**)
